Provenance
----------
ds4_math.cu is a verbatim copy of the file of that name from a cudaprof
capture directory, ~/tmp/cudaprof-1551522163, written 2026-09-12. It is
vendored rather than referenced because that directory is scratch: a
digest of a file that may not exist later is attributable but not
reproducible, and the point of the fixture is that a reader can
regenerate and diff rather than trust it. The parent artifacts in that
directory were:

